      "works_on": ["ingredient/cauliflower", "preparation/bechamel", "ingredient/gruyere"],
      "with": ["ingredient/butter"],
      "text": "Rub a gratin dish with the {butter}. Lay the florets in it, pour the sauce over them and scatter with the rest of the cheese.",
